      "message": "This is a corner case where sometimes RADIO_AVAILABLE event is received after subid change, due to which HAL command for DDS switch request is not updated and DDS request is not sent. As a result internet request is not processed blocking data call request.\n\nThis method is executed only if hal command is UNKNOWN",
