      "writtenOn": "2021-03-02T09:18:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You are using a single failure flag for all different failures, and then blindly retry when one of the condition changes. As I mentioned below, you should change the design to return a specific failure, then only retry when that failure condition is gone.",
