      "writtenOn": "2021-03-02T09:18:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You are guessing what the error might cause switch failure. In fact, there could be other reasons that caused the setPreferredDataModem or setAllowedData failed.\n\nThe right design is expanding the error codes in IRadioConfigResponse::setPreferredDataModemResponse, and returns an explicit error code indicating why the switch was failed. And then using the exception type to determine if you want to retry, or just wait for call inactive/sim ready event.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1505,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1515,
        "endChar": 13
      },
      "revId": "37e8595cf611e909504df38aaaa8779028310cb5",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
