      "writtenOn": "2021-03-05T10:03:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As discussed, setPreferredDataModemResponse doesnt return exact failure cause. Here we are guessing the possible source for DDS switch failures like active call, SIM not ready etc and scheduling retry.",
      "parentUuid": "1c356def_510b773f",
      "range": {
