      "writtenOn": "2021-03-02T09:18:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why is this specific for retry? Why is this not isValidForSwitch?\n\nMy point is why is the logic like this\nswitch-\u003efail-\u003eisPhoneIdValidForRetry-\u003eretry\n\nShouldn\u0027t that be\nisPhoneIdValidForSwitch-\u003eswitch or no switch?",
      "range": {
