        "id": 1040179
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-05T10:03:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For DDS switch triggered by user, valid subid and phoneid checks are already done in SubscriptionManager::setDefaultDataSubId. So we dont need this method for normal DDS switch.\n\nHere in this method we check for phoneid validity to trigger retry. While we hold DDS retry during call there can be a change in DDS with SIM hotswap or network requests, we ensure that DDS is set to the appropriate sub",
      "parentUuid": "244b7b82_a9b20ef4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1548,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1548,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "37e8595cf611e909504df38aaaa8779028310cb5",
